OL,4,CMarching bands scramble to cover costs 
OL,5,Cafter Thanksgiving parade rearranged   
OL,6,GTouring musicians from across the US   
OL,7,Gwho descended on New York City to      
OL,8,Gperform at the Macy's Thanksgiving     
OL,9,Gparade have turned to fundraising to   
OL,10,Gcover their costs, after getting stuck 
OL,11,Gwhen the event was rearranged due to a 
OL,12,Gstorm.                                 
OL,14,FA band from Texas told the BBC's US    
OL,15,Fpartner, CBS News, it had raised some  
OL,16,F$350,000 (#267,000) to pay for an      
OL,17,Fextended stay for its 500 members. It  
OL,18,Fsaluted the kindness of its supporters.
